+// The feet's slope traces of a person standing are asked so every frame (PM_FootSlopeTrace: 22 a frame of the walk, 0.18
+// million instructions). Kept by the exact words of start, end, mins, maxs, model and mask, one table a slot (SE_CoreSlot);
